{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24988","headline":"写意二首 二 · 牟融","name":"写意二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"萧萧华发满头生，深远蓬门倦送迎。\n独喜冥心无外慕，自怜知命不求荣。\n闲情欲赋思陶令，卧病和人问马卿。\n林下贫居甘困守，尽教城市不知名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牟融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}